<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Tarefas Disponíveis - TASKMZ</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7f5;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #047857, #16a34a);
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 18px 70px;
            border-radius: 0 0 30px 30px;
        }

        .top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .back {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
            border-radius: 14px;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 25px;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .subtitle {
            margin-top: 5px;
            font-size: 13px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 0 16px 25px;
        }

        .info {
            background: white;
            padding: 17px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-top: -42px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            color: #4b5563;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .info strong {
            color: #087f23;
        }

        .task {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            border: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        }

        .task-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .task-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1f2937;
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        .value {
            background: #dcfce7;
            color: #087f23;
            padding: 8px 11px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            white-space: nowrap;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .description {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 16px 0;
            white-space: pre-line;
            background: #fafafa;
            padding: 13px;
            border-radius: 13px;
        }

        .task-footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
            padding-top: 15px;
        }

        .available {
            color: #087f23;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .accept {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #087f23, #16a34a);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 17px;
            border-radius: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 13px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(8,127,35,0.18);
        }

        .accept:active {
            transform: scale(0.96);
        }

        .empty {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        .empty-icon {
            font-size: 55px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .empty strong {
            color: #1f2937;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .empty p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px 15px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 380px) {
            .task-header {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .value {
                align-self: flex-start;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="header">

    <div class="top">

        <a href="/dashboard" class="back">←</a>

        <div>
            <div class="title">📋 Tarefas Disponíveis</div>

            <div class="subtitle">
                Complete tarefas e aumente o seu saldo
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</div>


<div class="container">

    <div class="info">
        💡 <strong>Como funciona?</strong><br>
        Escolha uma tarefa, siga corretamente as instruções e envie a prova depois de concluir.
    </div>


    <% if (!tasks || tasks.length === 0) { %>

        <div class="empty">

            <div class="empty-icon">📭</div>

            <strong>Nenhuma tarefa disponível</strong>

            <p>
                Neste momento não existem tarefas disponíveis.
                Volte mais tarde para verificar novas oportunidades.
            </p>

        </div>

    <% } else { %>

        <% tasks.forEach(task => { %>

            <div class="task">

                <div class="task-header">

                    <div class="task-title">
                        <%= task.titulo %>
                    </div>

                    <div class="value">
                        💰 <%= Number(task.valor || 0).toFixed(2) %> MT
                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="description">
                    <%= task.descricao %>
                </div>


                <div class="task-footer">

                    <div class="available">
                        🟢 Disponível
                    </div>


                    <form action="/tasks/<%= task.id %>/accept" method="POST">

                        <button type="submit" class="accept">
                            Aceitar tarefa →
                        </button>

                    </form>

                </div>

            </div>

        <% }) %>

    <% } %>

</div>


<div class="footer">
    🇲🇿 <strong>TASKMZ</strong><br>
    Faça tarefas • Ganhe dinheiro
</div>

</body>
</html>
